# =====================================================================
# FULL-GMLC THREE-LOCATION PSAP CROSSCHECK v9
# =====================================================================
#
# ID TRUTH
# --------
# GMLC.PSAP_ID      <-> Boundary.NENA_ID
#                      canonical leading-zero comparison
#
# GMLC.FCC_PSAP_ID  <-> Boundary.FCC_ID
#
# Names are DISPLAY ONLY.
# Names NEVER determine SAME / DIFFERENT.
#
#
# LOCATIONS
# ---------
# CALLER:
#     LATITUDE / LONGITUDE
#
# CELL:
#     CELL_LATITUDE / CELL_LONGITUDE
#
# ESPOSREQ:
#     ESPOSREQ_LOC_LATITUDE / ESPOSREQ_LOC_LONGITUDE
#
#
# EXPECTED PSAP
# -------------
# For each location:
#
#     coordinate
#        -> GeoPandas spatial join
#        -> containing PSAP polygon
#        -> NENA ID + FCC ID
#
# *_EXPECTED_VS_ROUTED:
#
#     SAME
#         Expected PSAP identity == Routed PSAP identity
#
#     DIFFERENT
#         Expected PSAP identity != Routed PSAP identity
#
#     UNRESOLVED
#         One side could not be resolved reliably
#
#
# ROUTED RELATION
# ---------------
#
# *_ROUTED_RELATION:
#
#     INSIDE
#     OUTSIDE
#     BOUNDARY
#     UNRESOLVED_BOUNDARY
#
#
# DISTANCE
# --------
# All distances are METERS.
#
# Boundary-distance method:
#
#     PSAP-specific local Azimuthal Equidistant projection
#        -> nearest boundary point in metric space
#        -> inverse projection
#        -> final WGS84 Geod measurement
#
# This is more defensible than selecting a nearest point directly
# in raw longitude/latitude degrees.
#
#
# PERFORMANCE
# -----------
# Expensive Expected-PSAP spatial joins are performed only AFTER
# the configured Caller/Cell/ESPOSREQ distance/duration filters.
#
#
# OUTPUTS
# -------
# psap_three_location_crosscheck_v9.csv
#
# psap_three_location_routed_psap_stats_v9.csv
#
#
# IMPORTANT ABOUT MIN / MEAN / MAX
# --------------------------------
# These statistics are calculated across the FINAL FILTERED COHORT
# produced by this run, grouped by Routed PSAP.
#
# They are NOT statistics across all 4.6M GMLC calls.
#
# =====================================================================


